        "type": "single_choice",
        "question": "网格 DP：dp[i][j] 表示从左上角走到 (i,j) 的最大数字和，只能向右或向下，正确的状态转移为（　）。",
        "options": {
            "A": "dp[i][j] = a[i][j] + min(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1])",
            "B": "dp[i][j] = max(dp[i-1][j-1], dp[i][j])",
            "C": "dp[i][j] = a[i][j] + max(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1])",
            "D": "dp[i][j] = a[i][j] + dp[i-1][j-1]"
        },
        "answer": "C",
        "explanation": "到达 (i,j) 只能来自上方或左方，取两者较大者加当前格。"
    },
    {
