        "question": "已知 f[0]=0，f[1]=2，f[i] = max(f[i-1], f[i-2] + a[i])，a[1..5]={2,7,9,3,1}，则 f[5] =（　）。",
        "options": {
            "A": "10",
            "B": "11",
            "C": "12",
            "D": "22"
        },
        "answer": "C",
