        "type": "single_choice",
        "question": "一维数组优化 0/1 背包，横线处应填入（　）。\nfor (int c = W; c >= w[i]; c--) { _________; }",
        "options": {
            "A": "dp[c] = max(dp[c], dp[c + w[i]] + v[i])",
            "B": "dp[c] = min(dp[c], dp[c - w[i]] + v[i])",
            "C": "dp[c] = dp[c - w[i]] + v[i]",
            "D": "dp[c] = max(dp[c], dp[c - w[i]] + v[i])"
        },
        "answer": "D",
        "explanation": "逆序枚举容量，用上一层（未更新）的 dp[c-w[i]] 转移，保证每件物品最多选一次。"
    },
